    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WARNER BROS.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Warner Bros. is the record label that released Devo's album 'Something for Everybody' in 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0486-4e9b12b3edf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MUTATO MUZIKA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mutato Muzika is the recording studio in West Hollywood, California, where Devo's album 'Something for Everybody' was recorded."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0486-4e9b12b3edf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOB CASALE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bob Casale was a member of the band Devo until his death in 2014, and was featured on their album 'Something for Everybody' released in 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0486-4e9b12b3edf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BAZ LUHRMANN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Baz Luhrmann is a film director who released an album titled 'Something for Everybody' in 1998, containing new versions of music from his films and plays."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0486-4e9b12b3edf9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALLMUSIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
